{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The survival of the colony is in your hands!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SacriFrogos</strong>, you manage small creatures known as <strong>Frogos</strong> on a mysterious island, where survival depends on keeping the legendary <strong>Eternal Flame</strong> burning.<br>Its origin is unknown, but its demand is clear: <strong>greater and greater sacrifices will be required</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can seal the fate of your village or change the pace of each run. To survive, you must constantly balance growth and loss, knowing that every advantage comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/extras/cb9aaca4e0bc859873b1102d16396fd3.avif?t=1772571196\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your colony while facing unavoidable consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sacrificed Frogo strengthens the Eternal Flame, granting <strong>experience, crystals, and new strategic possibilities</strong>, but also weakening your community. As you progress, the pressure grows to decide who lives\u2026 and who will be offered to the flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is dynamic and shaped by your choices, demanding constant adaptation in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/extras/ca0056a6b73acf51c2f7c2ddfe575a2e.avif?t=1772571196\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice to get more levels and skill points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Random spell cards that change the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different skill trees: Obsession, Attachment, and Paranoia</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940180?t=1772571196","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/63c74c9abe93d2feb3eb0e9143b57dfc974a003c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772571196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/d62904af7a0a6497beae7d1b268b3e40d2c35e06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772571196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/d62904af7a0a6497beae7d1b268b3e40d2c35e06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772571196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3952270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The survival of the colony is in your hands!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>SacriFrogos</strong>, you manage small creatures known as <strong>Frogos</strong> on a mysterious island, where survival depends on keeping the legendary <strong>Eternal Flame</strong> burning.<br>Its origin is unknown, but its demand is clear: <strong>greater and greater sacrifices will be required</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can seal the fate of your village or change the pace of each run. To survive, you must constantly balance growth and loss, knowing that every advantage comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/extras/cb9aaca4e0bc859873b1102d16396fd3.avif?t=1772571196\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your colony while facing unavoidable consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sacrificed Frogo strengthens the Eternal Flame, granting <strong>experience, crystals, and new strategic possibilities</strong>, but also weakening your community. As you progress, the pressure grows to decide who lives\u2026 and who will be offered to the flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is dynamic and shaped by your choices, demanding constant adaptation in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/extras/ca0056a6b73acf51c2f7c2ddfe575a2e.avif?t=1772571196\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice to get more levels and skill points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Random spell cards that change the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different skill trees: Obsession, Attachment, and Paranoia</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["U\u00f3ki Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940180/f9632ef3495fcd87eee2e60ca9a92ccbbf21f83e/header.jpg?t=1772571196","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3940180/341975886/c0853b7725b21de5c066f666a1022f49de5b24b7/1771004341/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771005234","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3940180/341975886/c0853b7725b21de5c066f666a1022f49de5b24b7/1771004341/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771005234","highlight":true,"h